Bank Management System (C)

A simple Bank Management System developed using the C programming language.

About the Project

This is my first GitHub project. It is a menu-driven banking application that performs basic banking operations using C programming concepts.

Features

- Create a new bank account
- Deposit money
- Withdraw money
- Check account balance
- Exit the application

Technologies Used

- C Programming
- Standard Input/Output ("stdio.h")
- Arrays
- Loops
- Switch Statements
- Conditional Statements

Account Details

- Maximum Accounts: 100
- Starting Account Number: 1001
- Account Information: Account Number, Name and Balance

How to Run

1. Download the "Bank.c" file.
2. Open it in a C compiler.
3. Compile and run the program.
4. Select an option from the banking menu.

Learning Purpose

This project was created to improve my understanding of C programming, arrays, loops, functions and basic programming logic.

